像 ChatGPT 4、Generative Pre-trained Transformer 4、
O 以及 Google Gemini 这样的 LLMs 是复杂的 AI 系统，旨在理解并生成类人文本。
Large language models like ChatGPT 4, Generative Pre-trained Transformer 4, O, and Google
Gemini are sophisticated AI systems designed to comprehend and generate human-like text.

98
00:10:13,552 --> 00:10:18,752
这些模型是使用深度学习技术构建的，并在从互联网收集的海量数据集上进行训练。
These models are built using deep learning techniques and are trained on vast datasets collected from the internet.

99
00:10:19,054 --> 00:10:27,492
它们利用自注意力机制来分析词或标记之间的关系，
从而能够捕捉上下文并生成连贯且相关的回答。
They leverage self-attention mechanisms to analyze the relationship between words or tokens,
allowing them to capture context and produce coherent relevant responses.

100
00:10:27,822 --> 00:10:36,752
LLMs 有广泛的应用，包括驱动虚拟助手、chatbots、
内容创作、语言翻译，以及支持研究和决策制定。
LLMs have significant applications, including powering virtual assistant, chat boards,
content creation, language translation, and supporting research and decision making.

101
00:10:36,832 --> 00:10:44,272
它们生成流畅且符合上下文的文本的能力，推动了自然语言处理的进步，并改善了人机交互。
Their ability to generate fluent and contextually appropriate text has
advanced natural language processing and improved human-computer interaction.

102
00:10:44,398 --> 00:10:47,072
现在让我们来看看 LLMs 被用于哪些场景。
So now let's see what are large language models used for.

103
00:10:47,312 --> 00:10:53,392
LLMs 被用于在训练时缺乏或完全没有特定领域数据的情况下使用的场景。
Large language models are utilized in scenarios with limited or no domain-specific data available for training.

104
00:10:53,552 --> 00:11:05,712
这些场景包括少样本和零样本训练方法，它们依赖于模型的强大归纳偏置，
以及从少量数据甚至完全没有数据中推导出有意义表示的能力。
These scenarios include both few short and zero short training approaches, which rely on the model's strong inductive bias and its
capability to derive meaningful representation from a small amount of data or even no data at all.

105
00:11:05,872 --> 00:11:08,592
现在让我们看看 LLMs 是如何训练的。
So now let's see how large language models are trained.

106
00:11:08,832 --> 00:11:18,672
LLMs 通常在广泛的数据集上进行预训练，这些数据集在统计特征上与目标任务特定的数据集相似。
Large language models typically undergo pre-training on a board, all encompassing data
set that shares statical similarities with the dataset specific to the target task.

107
00:11:18,832 --> 00:11:27,392
预训练的目标是让模型获取高层特征，这些特征随后可以在特定任务的微调阶段中应用。
The objective of pre-training is to enable the model to acquire high-level
features that can later be applied during the fine-tuning phase for specific tasks.

108
00:11:27,552 --> 00:11:31,632
所以，LLM 的训练过程包含几个步骤。
So there are some training processes of LLM which involves several steps.

109
00:11:31,792 --> 00:11:33,632
第一步是文本预处理。
The first one is text preprocessing.

110
00:11:33,712 --> 00:11:38,672
文本数据被转换为 LLM 模型可以有效处理的数值表示。
The textual data is transformed into a numerical representation that the LLM model can effectively process.

111
00:11:38,832 --> 00:11:43,712
这种转换可能涉及分词、编码以及创建输入序列等技术。
This conversion may involve techniques like tokenization encoding and creating input sequences.

112
00:11:43,872 --> 00:11:46,032
第二步是随机参数初始化。
The second one is random parameter initialization.

113
00:11:46,192 --> 00:11:49,792
在训练过程开始之前，模型的参数会被随机初始化。
The model's parameters are initialized randomly before the training process begins.

114
00:11:49,902 --> 00:11:51,632
第三步是输入数值数据。
The third one is input numerical data.

115
00:11:51,792 --> 00:11:55,632
文本数据的数值表示被输入到处理模型中。
The numerical representation of the text data is fed into the model of processing.

116
00:11:55,758 --> 00:12:03,312
模型的架构通常基于 Transformer，使其能够捕捉文本中词或标记之间的上下文关系。
The model's architecture, typically based on transformers, allows it to
capture the contextual relationship between the words or tokens in the next.

117
00:12:03,406 --> 00:12:05,232
第四步是损失函数计算。
The fourth one is loss function calculation.

118
00:12:05,422 --> 00:12:11,716
损失函数计算衡量模型预测与句子中实际下一个词或标记之间的差异。
A loss function calculation measures the discrepancy between the model's prediction and the actual next word or token in a syntax.

119
00:12:12,014 --> 00:12:15,300
LLM 模型旨在训练过程中最小化这一损失。
The LLM model aims to minimize this loss during training.

120
00:12:15,534 --> 00:12:17,312
第五步是参数优化。
The fifth one is parameter optimization.

121
00:12:17,454 --> 00:12:20,420
模型的参数通过优化技术进行调整。
The model's parameters are adjusted through optimization technique.

122
00:12:20,512 --> 00:12:26,112
这涉及计算梯度并相应更新参数，从而逐渐提高模型的性能。
This involves calculating gradient and updating the parameters accordingly, gradually improving the model's performance.

123
00:12:26,286 --> 00:12:27,844
最后一个是迭代训练。
The last one is iterative training.

124
00:12:27,982 --> 00:12:37,712
训练过程会在多个迭代或轮次中重复，直到模型的输
出在给定的任务或数据集上达到令人满意的准确率。
The training process is repeated over multiple iterations or epochs until the model's
output achieve a satisfactory level of accuracy on that given task or dataset.

125
00:12:37,872 --> 00:12:47,588
通过遵循这一训练过程，大语言模型学会捕捉语言模式、理解上下文并生成连贯的回答，
使它们能够胜任各种与语言相关的任务。
By following this training process, large language models learn to capture linguistic patterns, understand context,
and generate coherent responses, enabling them to excel at various language related tasks.

126
00:12:47,792 --> 00:12:50,992
下一个话题是大语言模型是如何工作的？
The next topic is how do large language models work?

127
00:12:51,278 --> 00:12:57,392
所以，大语言模型利用深度神经网络，根据从训练数据中学到的模式来生成输出。
So, large language models leverage deep neural networks to generate output based on patterns learned from the training data.

128
00:12:57,552 --> 00:13:06,628
通常，大语言模型采用 Transformer架构，这使得模型能够
识别句子中单词之间的关系，而不管它们在序列中的位置。
Typically, a large language model adopts a transformer architecture which enables the model to identify the relationship between words
in a sentence irrespective of their position in the sequence.

129
00:13:07,008 --> 00:13:15,968
与依赖循环来捕捉标记关系的 RNNs 不同，transformer
neural network 使用自注意力机制作为主要机制。
In contrast to RNNs that rely on recurrence to capture token relationships, transform a neural network,
employ self-attention as their primary mechanism.

130
00:13:16,142 --> 00:13:26,436
自注意力机制计算注意力分数，从而确定文本序列中每个标记相对于其他标记的重要性，
便于对数据中复杂的关系进行建模。
Self-attention calculates attention scores that determine the importance of each token with respect to the other token in the text
sequence, facilitating the modeling of intricate relationship within the data.

