First, one clearly communicate when AI is used in content creation.

224
00:21:59,822 --> 00:22:05,188
提供你期望在输出中看到的具体提示词，这样它就不会偏离目标。
Provide with the specific prompts that you're expecting in your output so that it cannot miss on the target.

225
00:22:05,710 --> 00:22:21,348
其次，我们需要在分享或根据 AI 生成的信息采取行动之前进行验证，
因为在解释输入时我们可能会出错，或者在提供用于分析和生成报告的数据时可能存在差异。
Secondly, we need to verify AI-generated information before sharing or acting on it because there might be instances where we might go
wrong explaining our inputs or there might be some discrepancy in the data provided to analyze and generate a report.

226
00:22:21,678 --> 00:22:25,924
最后，了解 AI 如何做出决策，以避免过度依赖。
And lastly, understand how AI makes decisions to avoid over reliance.

227
00:22:26,382 --> 00:22:37,092
你需要了解 AI 的思考过程，并预判它可能生成什么样的结果，
这样你就不用每次都依赖同一个提示词。
You Need to understand the thought process of an AI and expect what kind of results it
might generate so that you don't have to rely on one single prompt every single time.

228
00:22:37,488 --> 00:22:41,284
现在，让我们继续讨论 AI 中可能存在的偏差。
Now, let's move ahead and address some potential biases in AI.

229
00:22:41,806 --> 00:22:45,088
AI 有时会反映其训练数据中存在的偏差。
AI can sometimes reflect biases present in its training data.

230
00:22:45,294 --> 00:22:52,484
常见的偏差包括普遍偏见、种族偏见、文化偏见、确认偏见和社会经济偏见。
Common biases include general bias, racial bias, cultural bias, confirmation bias, and socioeconomic biases.

231
00:22:53,006 --> 00:22:54,244
让我们逐一讨论这些偏差。
Let's discuss each one of them.

232
00:22:54,766 --> 00:22:56,208
首先是性别偏见。
Firstly, gender bias.

233
00:22:56,448 --> 00:23:03,108
AI 生成的职位描述可能会强化刻板印象，例如将工程师角色与男性联系在一起。
AI generated job descriptions may reinforce stereotypes, example, associating engineers' roles with men.

234
00:23:03,598 --> 00:23:05,668
第二个是种族偏见。
Second one is racial bias.

235
00:23:05,934 --> 00:23:11,268
人脸识别系统可能会误识别某些族裔背景的个人。
Facial recognition systems may misidentify individuals from certain ethnic backgrounds.

236
00:23:11,758 --> 00:23:13,188
第三个是文化偏见。
Third one, cultural bias.

237
00:23:13,568 --> 00:23:17,476
AI 在内容生成时可能会优先考虑西方视角。
AI might prioritize Western perspectives in content generation.

238
00:23:17,998 --> 00:23:19,556
第四个是确认偏见。
Fourth one, confirmation bias.

239
00:23:19,808 --> 00:23:25,648
它可能会通过偏好与过去搜索相似的信息来强化现有的信念。
It may reinforce existing beliefs by favoring information similar to past searches.

240
00:23:26,094 --> 00:23:28,036
最后是社会经济偏见。
Lastly, socioeconomic bias.

241
00:23:28,368 --> 00:23:34,148
例如，AI 生成的贷款审批可能会偏向高收入背景的个人。
For example, AI generated loan approvals may favor individuals from higher income backgrounds.

242
00:23:34,894 --> 00:23:37,924
现在你还需要关注负责任的提示词编写。
Now you also need to focus on responsible prompting.

243
00:23:38,158 --> 00:23:43,172
使用清晰且中立的语言，以避免影响偏差结果。
Use clear and neutral language to avoid influencing bias results.

244
00:23:43,566 --> 00:23:48,420
在生成回答时，要求 AI 提供多样化的视角和来源。
Ask AI to provide diverse perspectives and sources when generating responses.

245
00:23:48,688 --> 00:23:53,028
注意数据隐私，避免分享敏感的个人信息。
Be mindful of data privacy and avoid sharing sensitive personal information.

246
00:23:53,518 --> 00:23:57,092
