257
00:24:59,408 --> 00:25:07,488
我将把整个旅程分解为可管理的阶段，从基础知识到构建你自己的生成式 AI 项目。
I will be breaking down the entire journey into manageable phases from fundamental knowledge to building your own gen AI projects.

258
00:25:07,728 --> 00:25:12,208
在开始之前，让我告诉你什么是生成式 AI 或 生成式AI。
Before we begin, let me tell you what generative AI or Gen AI means.

259
00:25:12,624 --> 00:25:15,344
顾名思义，它就是在生成数据。
As the name suggests, it is generating data.

260
00:25:15,504 --> 00:25:19,984
这是一种利用现有数据来创建新数据的技术。
It's a technology where it uses existing data for creating new ones.

261
00:25:20,224 --> 00:25:25,744
它可能以文本、图像、音频、视频、代码甚至 3D 模型的形式出现。
It might be in the form of text, images, audio, video, code, or even 3D models.

262
00:25:25,904 --> 00:25:35,584
为了更好地理解，我将整个路线图分为四个阶段，外
加一个额外的奖励阶段，帮助你在这个领域脱颖而出。
For better understanding, I will be dividing the entire roadmap into four phases,
plus one additional phase as a bonus phase for you to excel in this field.

263
00:25:35,824 --> 00:25:41,572
第一阶段是打下基础，包括 AI 和机器学习的基础知识。
Phase one is all about laying the foundation, which includes the basics of AI and machine learning.

264
00:25:41,824 --> 00:25:47,664
把人工智能想象成让计算机变得足够聪明，去完成人类能做的事情。
Think of artificial intelligence as making computers smart enough to do things which people can do.

265
00:25:47,904 --> 00:25:55,664
机器学习只是实现这一目标的方法之一，它让计算
机能够从例子中学习，而不是被告知具体该做什么。
Machine learning is just one of the ways to do it, allowing computers to learn from example instead of being told exactly what to do.

266
00:25:55,904 --> 00:26:00,464
它是通过观察和实践来学习，而不仅仅是依靠规则手册。
It's a learning by seeing and doing it, not just by a rulebook.

267
00:26:00,704 --> 00:26:06,944
机器学习主要有三种类型：监督学习、无监督学习和强化学习。
There are three main types of machine learning: supervised learning, unsupervised learning, and reinforcement learning.

268
00:26:07,184 --> 00:26:14,784
监督学习是计算机在正确答案的指导下学习，而无监督学习涉及自行寻找模式。
Supervised learning is where the computers learn with correct answers,
whereas unsupervised learning involves finding patterns on its own.

269
00:26:14,944 --> 00:26:18,212
而强化学习则是通过奖励来学习。
And reinforcement learning is about learning through rewards.

270
00:26:18,464 --> 00:26:20,064
你还需要用到 Python。
You will need Python too.

271
00:26:20,238 --> 00:26:28,864
关键工具包括用于数值运算的 NumPy，用于组织数据的 Pandas，
以及用于数据可视化的 Matplotlib 和 Seaborn。
Key tools include NumPy for numerical operations, Pandas for organizing data, and Matplotlib and C Bond for data visualization.

272
00:26:29,104 --> 00:26:32,064
这些工具能帮助你处理和理解数据。
These help you to work with and understand data.

273
00:26:32,224 --> 00:26:36,996
你需要了解数据准备，这包括数据的清洗和整理。
You need to understand data preparation, which involves cleaning and organizing data.

274
00:26:37,264 --> 00:26:43,504
此外，还要学习特征工程，也就是筛选模型中重要数据部分的过程。
Also, learn about the feature engineering, which is the process of selecting important parts of the data of the model.

275
00:26:43,824 --> 00:26:45,584
生成式 AI 使用深度学习。
Gen AI uses deep learning.

276
00:26:45,744 --> 00:26:49,424
你可以把深度学习想象成一个拥有许多层的计算机网络。
You can think of deep learning as a computer network with many layers.

277
00:26:49,584 --> 00:26:53,104
要理解这些网络是如何从数据中学习的基本原理。
Understand the basic idea of how these networks learn from data.

278
00:26:53,264 --> 00:26:57,316
这是理解更复杂的生成式 AI 模型的关键。
This is a key for understanding more complex Gen AI models.

279
00:26:57,664 --> 00:27:02,064
进入第二阶段，你可以开始探索生成式 AI 模型。
Moving on to phase 2, where you can start exploring the Gen AI models.

280
00:27:02,304 --> 00:27:10,884
一些生成式 AI 模型包括 GANs，即两个网络相互竞争，一个生成虚假数据，另一个尝试识别它。
Some of Gen AI models include GANs, which are two networks competing, one making fake data and other tries to spot it.

281
00:27:11,184 --> 00:27:14,704
这种模型非常适合创建逼真的输出。
This model works well for creating realistic outputs.

282
00:27:14,944 --> 00:27:17,104
第二个模型是变分自编码器（变分自编码器）。
The second model is VAEs.

283
00:27:17,344 --> 00:27:22,544
这种模型通过学习数据的隐藏表示来创建新数据或相似数据。
This model learns a hidden representation of data to create new or similar data.

284
00:27:22,784 --> 00:27:31,504
下一个模型是 Transformer，它们擅长利用注意力机制来理解文本、
音频甚至图像等序列中的上下文。
The next model is transformers, which are excellent at understanding
context in sequence like text, audio, and even images using attention.

285
00:27:31,664 --> 00:27:38,064
最后一个模型是扩散模型，它可以通过逆转加噪过程来创建高质量数据。
The last model is diffusion model, which can create high-quality data by reversing a noising process.

286
00:27:38,224 --> 00:27:40,544
这种模型在图像领域非常流行。
This model is very popular for images.

287
00:27:40,784 --> 00:27:48,704
除了生成式 AI 模型，你还需要涵盖属于自然语言处理（NLP）的文本生成模型。
Apart from Gen AI models, you need to cover text generation model which falls under natural language processing, which is NLP.

288
00:27:48,864 --> 00:27:53,824
这些模型支持从撰写文章到翻译语言的各种文本创作。
These models power text creation from writing articles to translating languages.

289
00:27:53,984 --> 00:27:58,660
最后，你将学习使用 GANs 和扩散模型进行图像生成。
And lastly, you will cover image generation using GANs and diffusion models.

290
00:27:58,864 --> 00:28:02,944
在第三阶段，我们将专注于培养实践技能。
In phase 3, we will focus on developing our practical skills.

291
00:28:03,104 --> 00:28:08,304
你可以从小型项目开始，比如使用小型数据集生成基础图像或文本。
You can start with small projects such as generating basic images or text with small datasets.

292
00:28:08,704 --> 00:28:10,864
多做实验并学习工作流。
Do experiment and learn the workflow.

293
00:28:11,024 --> 00:28:17,892
加入 Hugging Face、Reddit、Stack Overflow 和 Kaggle 等平台，提问并向他人学习。
Join platforms like Hugging Face, Reddit, Stack Overflow, and Kaggle Forums to ask questions and learn from others.

294
00:28:18,144 --> 00:28:22,544
为了展示你的作品，你可以使用 GitHub 来分享你的项目和代码。
To showcase your work, you can use GitHub to share your projects and code.

295
00:28:22,704 --> 00:28:24,944
第四阶段的核心就是保持领先。
Phase 4 is truly about staying ahead.

296
00:28:25,184 --> 00:28:28,864
生成式 AI 一直在变化，所以你需要时刻关注它。
Gen AI is always changing, so you need to be aware of it.

297
00:28:29,104 --> 00:28:31,424
新的架构正在不断被构建。
New architectures are constantly being built.

298
00:28:31,504 --> 00:28:39,076
所以简单来说，你要意识到除了我们涵盖的基础知识外，更先进的模型一直在不断开发中。
So briefly be aware that more advanced models are continuously being developed beyond the basics that we have covered.

299
00:28:39,344 --> 00:28:49,024
我还建议学习如何在 AWS、Google Cloud 或 Azure
等云平台上部署模型，这对大型项目很有帮助。
I would also recommend learning about deploying models on cloud platforms
like AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure, which will be useful for larger projects.

300
00:28:49,264 --> 00:28:57,184
此外，你可以阅读研究论文，在 Twitter 或 LinkedIn
上关注技术专家，并保持对这个领域的好奇心。
Additionally, you can read research papers, follow tech experts online,
whether on Twitter or LinkedIn, and stay curious about this field.

301
00:28:57,358 --> 00:28:59,664
在这个领域，持续学习是关键。
Continuous learning is the key in this field.

302
00:28:59,824 --> 00:29:07,424
