01:16:46,958 --> 01:16:53,200
GAN 的训练过程，第一步是生成器制造虚假数据。
So the GAN training process is the first process is generator makes the fake data.

767
01:16:53,294 --> 01:16:58,852
第二步是判别器尝试区分真实与虚假。
Then the step two is the discriminator tries to classify the real versus fake.

768
01:16:59,246 --> 01:17:04,228
第三步是两者在每一轮中都变得更擅长自己的工作。
Then the third step is both get better at their jobs with each round.

769
01:17:04,480 --> 01:17:08,612
最终目标是用逼真的输出来欺骗判别器。
So the final goal is to fool the discriminator with the realistic outputs.

770
01:17:09,230 --> 01:17:13,284
Transformer 的底层原理是注意力机制。
So the transformers under the hood pays attention mechanism.

771
01:17:13,582 --> 01:17:17,360
它能帮助模型理解哪些词更重要。
So it helps model understand which words matter more.

772
01:17:17,678 --> 01:17:23,684
然后我们有自注意力机制，它允许模型同时查看句子中的所有词。
Then we have self-attention that is allows the model to look at all the words in a sentence at once.

773
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:33,220
接着我们有位置编码，它帮助追踪词的顺序，因为 Transformer 不像人类那样从左到右阅读。
And then we have positional, that is encoding, and it helps track the
orders of the words as transformers don't read left to right like humans.

