1025
01:44:22,592 --> 01:44:33,124
AI 模型是通过根据数据中的模式预测接下来会出现什么来生成内容的，但它们并不真正理解内容。
So AI models generate content by predicting what comes next based on
the patterns in data, but they don't truly understand the content.

1026
01:44:33,422 --> 01:44:39,712
例如，当 AI 创建文章或代码时，它并不知道自己正在写什么。
For example, when an AI creates an article or a code, it doesn't know what it's writing.

1027
01:44:39,792 --> 01:44:43,428
它只是根据过去的数据混合模式。
It's just mixing patterns based on the past data.

1028
01:44:44,192 --> 01:44:47,396
接下来是数据质量的依赖性。
Then moving on to the dependence on the data quality.

1029
01:44:47,726 --> 01:44:52,548
AI 的性能仅取决于它所训练的数据质量。
So the AI's performance is only as good as the data it's trained on.

1030
01:44:52,912 --> 01:44:59,396
