03:26:41,774 --> 03:26:46,000
为此，我们应该计算熵和信息增益。
For that, we should calculate entropy and information gain.

2099
03:26:46,320 --> 03:26:50,720
这里有两个重要的词汇：熵和信息增益。
Two important vocabulary words there are the entropy and the information gain.

2100
03:26:50,990 --> 03:26:51,600
熵。
Entropy.

2101
03:26:51,822 --> 03:26:55,840
熵是衡量数据集中随机性或不纯度的指标。
Entropy is a measure of randomness or impurity in the data set.

2102
03:26:56,174 --> 03:26:57,360
熵应该是低的。
Entropy should be low.

2103
03:26:57,550 --> 03:27:00,000
所以我们希望混乱程度尽可能低。
So we want the chaos to be as low as possible.

2104
03:27:00,238 --> 03:27:04,960
我们不希望看到混合数据时感到困惑。
We don't want to look at it and be confused by the images or what's going on there with mixed data.

2105
03:27:05,134 --> 03:27:06,468
还有信息增益。
And the information gain.

2106
03:27:06,640 --> 03:27:13,760
它是衡量数据集切分后熵减少的指标，也称为熵减。
It is a measure of decrease in entropy after the data set is split, also known as entropy reduction.

2107
03:27:14,240 --> 03:27:16,000
信息增益应该是高的。
Information gain should be high.

2108
03:27:16,206 --> 03:27:20,320
所以我们希望从切分中获得的信息尽可能高。
So we want our information that we get out of the split to be as high as possible.

2109
03:27:20,686 --> 03:27:24,000
让我们从数学角度来看看熵。
Let's take a look at entropy from the mathematical side.

2110
03:27:24,302 --> 03:27:37,440
在这种情况下，我们将熵表示为 i of p of n，其中 p
是你玩高尔夫球的概率，n 是你不玩高尔夫球的概率。
In this case, we're going to denote entropy as i of p of n, where p is the probability that you're going to play a game of golf,
and n is the probability where you're not going to play the game of golf.

2111
03:27:37,678 --> 03:27:39,760
现在，你并不真的需要去死记硬背这些公式。
Now you don't really have to memorize these formulas.

2112
03:27:39,920 --> 03:27:42,400
根据你处理的内容不同，会有几个不同的公式。
There's a few of them out there depending on what you're working with.

2113
03:27:42,638 --> 03:27:51,280
但重要的是要记住这些公式的来源，这样当你看到它们时，在运行程序时就不会感到困惑，
除非你是在后台自己编写决策树代码。
But it's important to note that this is where this formula is coming from, so when you see it,
you're not lost when you're running your programming, unless you're building your own decision tree code in the back.

2114
03:27:51,566 --> 03:27:59,760
我们的公式很简单，就是 p 除以 p 加 n 的对数平方，
减去 n 除以 p 加 n 乘以 n 除以 p 加 n 的对数平方。
And we simply have a log squared of p over p plus n minus n over p plus n times the log squared of n of p plus n.

2115
03:27:59,982 --> 03:28:05,520
但让我们把它拆解一下，看看在计算机脚本端计算时它到底是什么样子的。
But let's break that down and see what it actually looks like when we're computing that from the computer script side.

2116
03:28:05,934 --> 03:28:09,440
数据集目标类别的熵就是总熵。
Entropy of a target class of the dataset is the whole entropy.

2117
03:28:09,678 --> 03:28:11,440
所以我们有「熵：玩高尔夫球」。
So we have entropy play golf.

2118
03:28:11,822 --> 03:28:20,320
当我们看这个时，如果回到数据中，你只需简单计算完
整数据集中玩高尔夫球的天数里有多少个“是”和“否”。
And when we look at this, if we go back to the data, you can simply count
how many yeses and no in our complete data set for playing golf days.

2119
03:28:20,560 --> 03:28:26,880
在我们的完整数据集中，我们发现有 5 天我们玩了高尔夫球，有 9 天我们没玩。
In our complete set, we find we have five days we did play golf and nine days we did not play golf.

2120
03:28:27,150 --> 03:28:31,040
所以我们的 i 等于，把它们加起来，9 加 5 等于 14。
And so our i equals, if you add those together, nine plus five is fourteen.

2121
03:28:31,246 --> 03:28:35,040
所以我们的 i 等于 5 除以 14 和 9 除以 14。
And so our i equals five over fourteen and nine over fourteen.

2122
03:28:35,120 --> 03:28:37,892
这就是我们要代入公式的 p 和 n 值。
That's our p and n values that we plug into that formula.

2123
03:28:38,126 --> 03:28:43,389
你可以计算 5 除以 14 等于 0.36，9 除以 14 等于 0.64。
And you can go five over fourteen equals 0.36, nine over fourteen equals 0.64.

2124
03:28:43,822 --> 03:28:47,024
当你计算整个方程时，你会得到减号。
And when you do the whole equation, you get the minus.

2125
03:28:47,086 --> 03:28:54,149
0.36 乘以 0.36 的对数平方，减去 0.64 乘以 0.64 的对数平方。
0.36 log root squared of 0.36 minus 0.64 log squared root of 0.64.

2126
03:28:54,414 --> 03:28:57,360
我们得到一个设定值，是 0.94。
And we get a set value, we get 0.94.

2127
03:28:58,080 --> 03:29:02,720
所以我们现在有了我们正在处理的整个数据集的完整熵值。
So we now have a full entropy value for the whole set of data that we're working with.

2128
03:29:03,022 --> 03:29:05,040
我们希望让这个熵值降低。
And we want to make that entropy go down.

2129
03:29:05,294 --> 03:29:12,320
就像我们计算出整个数据集的熵一样，我们也可以计算玩高尔夫球和 Outlook 的熵。
And just like we calculated the entropy out for the whole set, we can also calculate entropy for playing golf and the outlook.

