有多少个晴天是“否”，除以总数 5。
And so we look at the entropy, we have p of sunny times e of three of two, and that just comes out how many sunny days yes and how
many sunny days no over the total, which is five.

2132
03:29:26,560 --> 03:29:34,800
别忘了稍后我们要除以那个 5，等于 p overcast 等于 4.0，加上 rainy 等于 2.3。
Don't forget to put the we'll divide that five out later on, equals
p overcast equals four comma zero plus rainy equals two comma three.

2133
03:29:34,990 --> 03:29:39,280
然后当你完成整个设置时，我们有 5 除以 14。
And then when you do the whole setup, we have five over fourteen.

2134
03:29:39,598 --> 03:29:50,756
记得我说总数是 5，5 除以 14 乘以 i of 3 of 2 加上 4 除以 14 乘以 4.0，
再加上 5 除以 14 除以 i of 2 of 3。
Remember I said there was a total of five, five over fourteen times the i of three of two
plus four over fourteen times the four comma zero and five fourteen over i of two three.

2135
03:29:50,960 --> 03:29:58,240
所以我们现在可以计算仅与预测相关的部分熵，我们得到 0.693。
And so we can now compute the entropy of just the part it has to do with the forecast, and we get 0.693.

2136
03:29:58,640 --> 03:30:03,760
同样，我们可以计算其他预测因子，如温度、湿度和风速的熵。
