03:30:10,926 --> 03:30:21,520
我们可以用整套数据的原始 0.94 减去仅包含「雨天」和「温度」的熵，最后得到 0.247 的增益。
And we can take the original 0.94 for the whole set minus the entropy of
just the rainy day and temperature, and we end up with a gain of 0.247.

2141
03:30:21,998 --> 03:30:23,920
这就是我们的信息增益。
So this is our information gain.

2142
03:30:24,110 --> 03:30:27,440
