So, what exactly is Langchain?

3374
05:09:33,870 --> 05:09:48,388
LangChain 是一个开源框架，旨在帮助开发者构建由大语言模型驱动的应用程序，
它提供工具和抽象层，以简化将 LLMs 与外部数据源和工作流集成的过程。
Langchain is an open source framework designed to help developers build applications powered by large language models by providing
tools and abstractions to simplify the process of integrating LLMs with external data sources and workflows.

3375
05:09:48,816 --> 05:09:56,896
现在，想象一下你正在构建一个 AI 应用程序，其中需要
像 GPT 4 这样的 LLM 模型来生成对你查询的初始响应。
Now, imagine you're building an AI application where an LLM model like GPT 4 is needed to generate an initial response to your query.

3376
05:09:57,646 --> 05:10:01,380
使用 Llama 3 或其他版本来优化那个响应。
Lama 3 or other versions to refine that response.

3377
05:10:01,680 --> 05:10:11,760
一个定制构建的智能体来决定它是否可以毫无障碍地回答查询，
还是必须获取外部资源来生成响应。
A custom-built AI agent to decide whether it can answer the query without
a hiccup or if it has to fetch external sources to generate a response.

3378
05:10:12,000 --> 05:10:16,800
最重要的是，一个可靠的记忆来存储所有之前的用户交互。
Most importantly, a solid memory to store all previous user interactions.

3379
05:10:17,006 --> 05:10:22,980
如果没有 Langchain，手动管理所有这些组件就需要大量的编码工作。
Without Langchain, managing all these components manually would require extensive coding.

3380
05:10:23,374 --> 05:10:38,596
你需要编写自定义代码片段来处理对 GPT、Llama 等 LLM 的 API 调用，
创建并维护专门的记忆空间，最重要的是，还要构建一个具备完全自定义决策能力的 AI 智能体。
You need to write a custom code snippet to handle API calls to your LLM like GPT, Lama,
create and maintain a dedicated memory space and most importantly, a fully customized decision-making capable AI agent.

3381
05:10:38,926 --> 05:10:44,880
