Langflow is a visual, low code framework built upon top of Langchain, enabling developers to easily design and test AI applications,
especially those involving multi-agent systems and retrieval augmented generation or RAT.

3430
05:14:50,110 --> 05:14:54,660
涉及多智能体系统和检索增强生成（RAT）的应用。
Langflow is a visual, low code framework built upon top of Langchain, enabling developers to easily design and test AI applications,
especially those involving multi-agent systems and retrieval augmented generation or RAT.

3431
05:14:55,118 --> 05:15:01,968
