Langflow 构建在 LangChain 之上，为设计 LangChain 工作流提供可视化界面。
Langflow is built upon top of Langchain and provides a visual interface for designing Langchain workflows.

3434
05:15:12,718 --> 05:15:20,580
它非常适合 LLM 应用的原型设计，允许用户快速设计工作流、链和智能体并进行测试。
It is perfect for prototyping LLM applications, allowing users to quickly design workflows, chains and agents and test them.

3435
