频分析，即通过分析视频帧来识别动作、物体和场景。
LSTM models are highly effective and used in various applications, including video analysis,
analyzing video frames to identify action, object, and scenes.

4688
07:12:32,494 --> 07:12:38,276
第二个是语言模拟，包括语言建模、机器翻译和文本摘要等任务。
The second is language simulation, tasks like language modeling, machine translation, and text summarization.

4689
07:12:38,798 --> 07:12:40,676
第三个是时间序列预测。
The third one is time series prediction.

4690
07:12:41,024 --> 07:12:43,492
也就是预测时间序列中的未来数值。
So predicting future values in a time series.

4691
07:12:44,494 --> 07:12:46,020
第四个是语音识别。
