4693
07:12:51,054 --> 07:12:56,464
最后一个是情感分析，比如对 URL 上的文本情感进行正向或负向分类。
The last one is sentiment analysis, classifying text sentiment as positive, negative on URL.

4694
07:12:56,704 --> 07:12:58,784
所以 LSTM 还有很多其他的应用例子。
So there are many more examples of LSTM.

4695
07:12:58,864 --> 07:13:03,204
现在让我们继续深入了解 LSTM 模型及其工作原理，并结合例子来讲解。
So now let's move forward and understand LSTM model and how it works with example.

4696
07:13:03,504 --> 07:13:06,628
让我们考虑预测句子中下一个词的任务。
Let's consider the task of predicting the next word in a sentence.

4697
07:13:06,958 --> 07:13:10,340
这是 LSTM 网络在自然语言处理中的一个常见应用。
This is a common application of LSTM networks in natural language processing.

4698
07:13:10,704 --> 07:13:17,824
我将通过“记住故事并根据上下文决定接下来发生什么”的类比，一步步拆解这个过程。
So I will break it down step by step using the analogy of remembering a story and deciding what comes next based on the context.

4699
07:13:17,904 --> 07:13:19,664
想象一下你正在读一个故事。
So imagine you are reading a story.

4700
07:13:19,824 --> 07:13:25,092
在阅读过程中，你需要记住到目前为止发生的事情，以便预测接下来可能会发生什么。
As you read, you need to remember what has happened so far to predict what might happen next.

4701
07:13:25,518 --> 07:13:28,384
让我们用一个简单的例子来演示一下。
So let's illustrate with a simple example center.

4702
07:13:28,864 --> 07:13:30,852
猫坐在仪表盘上。
The cat sat on the dash.

4703
07:13:31,246 --> 07:13:35,588
所以你想预测下一个词，可能是垫子、屋顶或者别的什么。
So you want to predict the next word, which could be mat or roof or something else.

4704
07:13:36,177 --> 07:13:43,332
LSTM 网络通过记住故事的重要部分并遗忘无关的细节来帮助做出预测。
And LSTM network helps this make prediction by remembering important parts of the story and forgetting irrelevant details.

4705
07:13:43,598 --> 07:13:45,796
现在让我们逐步深入了解这个过程。
So now let's dive into step by step process.

4706
07:13:45,998 --> 07:13:48,452
所以，让我们逐步了解使用 LSTM 的过程。
So step by step acclimation using LSTM.

4707
07:13:48,544 --> 07:13:51,104
第一步是阅读故事，也就是输入序列。
The first one is reading the story, input sequence.

4708
07:13:51,264 --> 07:13:55,876
当你阅读句子中的每个词时，你会处理它并存储相关信息。
As you read each word in the word sentence, you process it and store relevant information.

4709
07:13:56,078 --> 07:14:03,300
例如，你理解它的限定词，猫，你知道它是一个名词，也是句子的主语。
For example, the you understand its determiner, cat, you know it's a noun and the subject of the sentence.

4710
07:14:03,744 --> 07:14:07,076
Set 表示主语执行的动作。
Set indicates the action performed by the subject.

4711
07:14:07,504 --> 07:14:11,716
介词 On 表示猫和下一个名词之间的关系。
On preposition indicating the relationship between the cat and the next noun.

4712
07:14:11,984 --> 07:14:16,544
所以这个序列图展示了正在被阅读和处理的词。
So this sequence diagram showing the words being read and processed.

4713
07:14:16,878 --> 07:14:18,436
接下来是第二步，遗忘门。
So second comes forget gate.

4714
07:14:18,798 --> 07:14:22,864
当你读到句子的不同部分时，你可能会觉得某些细节不再重要了。
As you move through the sentence, you might decide that some details are no longer important.

4715
07:14:23,150 --> 07:14:29,184
例如，你可能会觉得既然已经有了 get 和 set，那么知道 the 就没那么重要了。
For instance, you might decide that knowing the is less important now that you have get and set.

4716
07:14:30,030 --> 07:14:34,116
所以遗忘门可以帮助丢弃这些不太重要的信息。
So the word forget gate help discard this less important information.

4717
07:14:34,510 --> 07:14:39,684
所以屏幕上的这个序列图展示了相关信息是如何被丢弃的。
So this sequence diagram you can see on the screen showing how relevant information is discarded.

4718
07:14:40,302 --> 07:14:42,084
第三个是输入门。
So the third one, input gate.

