5045
07:49:05,870 --> 07:49:07,328
那么，什么是大语言模型基准测试？
So, what are LLM benchmarks?

5046
07:49:07,534 --> 07:49:12,128
大语言模型基准测试是用于评估大语言模型性能的标准工具。
LLM benchmarks are standardized tools used to evaluate the performance of large language models.

5047
07:49:12,238 --> 07:49:19,728
它们提供了一种结构化的方式，利用样本数据和预定义的指标
来测试 LLMs 在特定任务或问题上的表现，从而衡量其能力。
They provide a structured way to test LLMs on a specific task or question
using sample data and predefined metrics to measure their capabilities.

5048
07:49:19,982 --> 07:49:28,740
这些基准测试评估各种技能，如编程、常识推理，以及机器翻译、问答和文本摘要等 NLP 任务。
These benchmarks assess various skills such as coding, common sense reasoning,
and NLP tasks like machine translation, question answering, and text summarization.

5049
07:49:28,878 --> 07:49:33,168
大语言模型基准测试的重要性在于它们在推动模型开发中所扮演的角色。
The importance of LLM benchmarks lies in their role in advancing model development.

5050
07:49:33,328 --> 07:49:40,768
它们追踪 LLM 的进展，为模型表现良好的地方和需要改进的地方提供定量见解。
They track the progress of an LLM, offering quantitative insights into where the model performs well and where improvement is needed.

5051
07:49:41,008 --> 07:49:47,648
这些反馈对于指导微调过程至关重要，让研究人员和开发者能够提升模型性能。
This feedback is crucial for guiding the fine-tuning process, allowing researchers and developers to enhance model performance.

5052
07:49:47,808 --> 07:49:56,612
此外，基准测试还提供了不同 LLMs 之间的客观对比，帮助开发者和组织根据需求选择最佳模型。
Additionally, benchmarks offers an objective comparison between different LLMs,
helping developers and organizations choose the best model for their needs.

5053
07:49:56,848 --> 07:49:58,768
那么，大语言模型基准测试是如何工作的呢？
So, how LLM benchmarks work.

5054
07:49:58,990 --> 07:50:01,968
大语言模型基准测试遵循一个清晰且系统化的流程。
LLM benchmarks follow a clear and systematic process.

5055
07:50:02,158 --> 07:50:10,448
它们给 LLM 提供一个需要完成的任务，使用特定指标评估其表现，并根据模型的表现分配分数。
They present a task for LLM to complete, evaluate its performance using specific metrics,
and assign a score based on how well the model performs.

5056
07:50:10,670 --> 07:50:13,648
下面是这个过程的工作原理分解。
So here is a breakdown of how this process works.

5057
07:50:13,902 --> 07:50:14,980
第一步是设置。
The first one is setup.

5058
07:50:15,246 --> 07:50:23,876
大语言模型基准测试配备了预先准备好的样本数据，
包括编程挑战、长文档、数学问题和现实世界的对话。
LLM benchmarks come with pre-prepared sample data including coding
challenges, long documents, math problems, and real-world conversation.

5059
07:50:24,048 --> 07:50:34,288
任务涵盖了常识推理、问题解决、问答、摘要生成和翻译等多个领域，
这些内容都会在测试开始时呈现给模型。
The task span various areas like common sense reasoning, problem solving, question answering, summary generation, and translation,
all present to the model at the start of testing.

5060
07:50:34,478 --> 07:50:36,128
第二步是测试。
The second step is testing.

5061
07:50:36,302 --> 07:50:38,448
模型将通过三种方式之一进行测试。
The model is tested on one of the three ways.

5062
07:50:38,734 --> 07:50:46,448
少样本，在提示 LLM 完成任务之前提供几个例子，展示其从有限数据中学习的能力。
Few short, the LLM is provided with a few examples before being prompted to complete a task,
demonstrating its ability to learn from limited data.

5063
07:50:46,608 --> 07:50:48,068
第二种是零样本。
The second one is zero shot.

5064
07:50:48,208 --> 07:50:56,208
要求模型在没有任何先验例子的情况下执行任务，测试其理解新概念和适应陌生场景的能力。
The model is asked to perform a task without any prior examples, testing
its ability to understand new concepts and adapt to unfamiliar scenarios.

5065
07:50:56,288 --> 07:50:57,540
第三种是微调。
The third one is fine-tuned.

5066
07:50:57,648 --> 07:51:05,408
模型在与基准测试中使用的类似的数据集上进行训练，旨在提高其在特定任务中的表现。
The model is trained on a dataset similar to the one used in the benchmark,
aiming to enhance its performance on the specific task involved.

5067
07:51:05,568 --> 07:51:07,044
第三步是评分。
The third step is scoring.

5068
07:51:07,328 --> 07:51:17,648
所以完成任务后，基准测试会将模型的输出与预期答案进行对比并生成分数，
通常范围在 0 到 100 之间，反映 LLM 的表现准确程度。
So after completing the task, the benchmark compares the model's output with the expected answer and generates a score,
typically ranging from 0 to 100, reflecting how accurately the LLM performs.

5069
07:51:17,902 --> 07:51:19,248
现在让我们继续往下看。
So now let's move forward.

5070
07:51:19,568 --> 07:51:22,404
让我们来看看评估 LLMs 的关键指标。
Let's see key metrics for benchmarking LLMs.

5071
07:51:22,734 --> 07:51:27,568
所以 LLM 的基准测试使用各种指标来评估大语言模型的效果。
So LLM's benchmark uses various metrics to assess the performance of large language model.

5072
07:51:27,822 --> 07:51:29,728
这里有一些常用的指标。
So here are some commonly used metrics.

5073
07:51:30,048 --> 07:51:32,208
第一个是准确率或精确率。
The first one is accuracy or precision.

5074
07:51:32,398 --> 07:51:35,328
衡量模型做出正确预测的百分比。
Measure the percentage of correct prediction made by the model.

5075
07:51:35,760 --> 07:51:37,120
第二个是召回率。
The second one is recall.

5076
07:51:37,326 --> 07:51:38,640
也称为灵敏度。
Also known as sensitivity.

5077
07:51:38,800 --> 07:51:43,280
衡量模型做出正确预测的真阳性数量。
Measure the number of true positives reflecting the correct prediction made by the model.

5078
07:51:43,502 --> 07:51:44,932
第三个是 F1 score。
The third one is F1 score.

5079
07:51:45,120 --> 07:51:51,440
它将准确率和召回率结合成一个单一指标，平等权衡它们，以解决任何假阳性或假阴性问题。
Combines both accuracy and recall into a single metric, weighing them equally to address any false positive or negatives.

5080
07:51:51,827 --> 07:51:56,240
F1 score 的范围是 0 到 1，其中 1 表示完美的精确率和召回率。
F1 score ranging from 0 to 1, where 1 indicates perfect precision and recall.

5081
07:51:56,366 --> 07:51:57,924
第四个是精确匹配。
The fourth one is exact match.

5082
07:51:58,254 --> 07:52:05,860
追踪预测结果与正确答案完全匹配的百分比，这尤其用于翻译和问答等任务。
Tracks the percentage of predictions that exactly match the correct answer,
which is especially used for the tasks like translation and question answering.

5083
07:52:06,160 --> 07:52:08,228
第五个是困惑度衡量。
The fifth one is perplexity gauges.

5084
07:52:08,560 --> 07:52:13,120
这里它会告诉你模型预测下一个词或标记的准确程度。
Here it will tell you how well a model predicts the next word or token.

5085
07:52:13,230 --> 07:52:17,600
较低的困惑度分数表示模型对任务的理解更好。
A lower perplexity score indicates better task comprehension by the model.

5086
07:52:17,806 --> 07:52:30,020
第六个是 BLEU，用于评估机器翻译，通过比较模型输
出与人工翻译之间的 Ngrams，即相邻文本元素的序列。
The sixth one is blue, bilingual evaluation Understudy, is used for evaluating machine translation by comparing Ngrams,
sequence of adjacent text elements between the model's output and the human produced translation.

5087
07:52:30,400 --> 07:52:34,160
所以这些定量指标通常会结合起来，以进行更全面的评估。
So these quantitative metrics are often combined for more through evaluation.

5088
07:52:34,318 --> 07:52:40,964
此外，人工评估引入了连贯性、相关性和语义含义等定性因素。
So in addition, human evaluation introduces qualitatively factors like coherence, relevance, and semantic meaning.

5089
07:52:41,280 --> 07:52:42,756
提供更细致的评估。
Provide a nuanced assessment.

5090
07:52:42,960 --> 07:52:51,520
然而，人工评估可能耗时且具有主观性，因此在全面评估中，平衡定量和定性衡量非常重要。
However, human evaluation can be time-consuming and subjective, making a balance
between quantitative and qualitative measures important for comprehensive evaluation.

5091
07:52:51,758 --> 07:52:55,280
现在让我们继续看一些 LLM 基准测试的局限性。
So now let's moving forward and see some limitation of LLM benchmarking.

5092
07:52:55,374 --> 07:53:03,492
虽然 LLM 基准测试可以用来评估模型性能，但它们有一些局限性，
导致它们无法完全预测现实世界中的有效性。
While LLM benchmarking are available for assessing model performance, they have
several limitations that prevent them from fully predicting real-world effectiveness.

5093
07:53:03,726 --> 07:53:04,804
这里有一些例子。
So here are some few.

5094
07:53:05,200 --> 07:53:07,012
第一个是评分受限。
The first one is bounded scoring.

5095
07:53:07,200 --> 07:53:16,772
一旦模型在基准测试中获得了最高可能的分数，该基准测试就会失去效用，
必须更新更具挑战性的任务，才能继续作为有意义的评估工具。
Once a model achieves the highest possible scores on the benchmark, that benchmark loses its utility and must be updated with more
challenging tasks to remain a meaningful assessment tool.

5096
07:53:16,960 --> 07:53:18,640
第二个是广泛的数据集。
The second one is broad data set.

5097
07:53:18,894 --> 07:53:22,747
大语言模型基准测试通常依赖于来自不同主题和任务的样本数据。
LLM benchmarks often rely on sample data from diverse subject and task.

5098
07:53:22,958 --> 07:53:32,000
因此，这种广泛的范围可能无法有效评估模型在边缘案例、
专业领域或需要更定制数据的特定使用场景中的表现。
So this wide scope may not effectively evaluate a model's performance in edge cases,
specialized fields or specific use cases where more tailored data would be needed.

5099
07:53:32,238 --> 07:53:33,760
第三个是有限的评估。
The third one is finite assessment.

5100
07:53:34,030 --> 07:53:43,588
基准测试只能测试模型的当前技能，随着 LLMs 的演变和新能力的出现，
必须创建新的基准测试来衡量这些进步。
Benchmark only tests a model current skills, and as LLMs evolve and new capabilities emerge,
new benchmarks must be created to measure these advancements.

5101
07:53:43,758 --> 07:53:45,040
第四个是过拟合。
The fourth one is overfitting.

5102
07:53:45,166 --> 07:53:54,244
如果一个 LLM 是用用于基准测试的相同数据训练的，可能会导致过拟合，
即模型在测试数据上表现良好，但在实际任务中表现不佳。
So if an LLM is trained on the same data used for benchmarking, it can be lead to
overfitting where the model performs well on the test data but struggles with the real task.

5103
07:53:54,560 --> 07:53:59,076
所以，这种结果得到的得分并不能真实代表模型的广泛能力。
So this result is scores that don't truly represent the model's broader capabilities.

